.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH oct-sign-cleartext 1  "oct-sign-cleartext " 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
oct\-sign\-cleartext \- Create a cleartext signature
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBoct sign cleartext\fR [\fB\-o\fR|\fB\-\-output\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIinput\fR] 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Create a cleartext signature
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output\fR \fI<output>\fR
Output file (stdout if unset)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIinput\fR]
Input file (stdin if unset)
